        "commentDate": "2024-08-03T19:59:32.2261034",
        "htmlComment": "<p>لخلخه ،عطری آمیخته ازچند عطربه دستوری خاص.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "publishStatus": "",
        "inReplyToId": null,
        "userId": "9c1484ac-2563-4f09-8f04-08da46ecb453",
        "replies": [],
